1
00:01:43,200 --> 00:01:43,920
Look here, everyone.

2
00:01:44,599 --> 00:01:47,239
A prominent leader in our nation's chemical research,

3
00:01:47,359 --> 00:01:49,280
from Nanhai University's Institute of Chemical Engineering,

4
00:01:49,319 --> 00:01:50,480
Professor Du Guangming,

5
00:01:50,640 --> 00:01:51,560
two weeks ago,

6
00:01:51,760 --> 00:01:53,040
was invited to Country M

7
00:01:53,040 --> 00:01:54,239
to attend an academic conference.

8
00:01:55,200 --> 00:01:57,120
He suddenly lost contact during the event.

9
00:01:57,400 --> 00:01:58,719
Subsequent investigations revealed that

10
00:01:59,120 --> 00:02:02,159
Professor Du Guangming was abducted and taken away.

11
00:02:02,840 --> 00:02:04,040
Interpol

12
00:02:04,560 --> 00:02:05,760
has placed its suspicions

13
00:02:05,920 --> 00:02:07,400
squarely on the Piyazi Gang.

14
00:02:07,480 --> 00:02:10,039
Currently, the Chinese Embassy in Country M

15
00:02:10,479 --> 00:02:12,039
is urging Country M's police

16
00:02:12,120 --> 00:02:13,520
to solve this case as soon as possible.

17
00:02:13,599 --> 00:02:16,240
We attach great importance to this case,

18
00:02:16,240 --> 00:02:17,159
and have decided to dispatch

19
00:02:17,319 --> 00:02:18,840
an experienced, elite officer

20
00:02:19,000 --> 00:02:20,919
to assist Country M's police with the investigation.

21
00:02:21,199 --> 00:02:22,360
Prior investigations indicate that

22
00:02:22,719 --> 00:02:25,840
Li Qiang will meet Ma Jingrong in Country M.

23
00:02:25,960 --> 00:02:27,560
Colleague Li Xiao is now instructed,

24
00:02:28,159 --> 00:02:29,080
while in Country M

25
00:02:29,319 --> 00:02:31,319
investigating Ms. Tian Xin's whereabouts,

26
00:02:31,919 --> 00:02:34,680
to simultaneously undertake the rescue

27
00:02:34,680 --> 00:02:36,080
of Professor Du Guangming on this mission.

28
00:02:41,520 --> 00:02:44,120
Our investigation will soon close in on

29
00:02:44,120 --> 00:02:46,639
the Xiang syndicate, the major drug lords of Jiechan State.

30
00:02:47,439 --> 00:02:49,039
I believe that with our efforts,

31
00:02:49,120 --> 00:02:50,560
alongside Country M's police

32
00:02:50,879 --> 00:02:53,400
and the strong backing of Interpol,

33
00:02:54,360 --> 00:02:56,680
we will surely eradicate the Piyazi Gang

34
00:02:56,960 --> 00:02:58,080
and the Theerade syndicate,

35
00:02:58,360 --> 00:02:59,840
rooting out these two malignant tumors.

36
00:03:01,120 --> 00:03:01,840
At present,

37
00:03:02,120 --> 00:03:04,080
Operation Thunderbolt's main battleground

38
00:03:04,400 --> 00:03:07,319
has shifted from Nanhai to the border and Country M.

39
00:03:08,039 --> 00:03:09,439
The officers of our anti-narcotics unit

40
00:03:10,199 --> 00:03:12,400
must, throughout this major operation,

41
00:03:12,560 --> 00:03:13,400
redouble their efforts,

42
00:03:13,599 --> 00:03:15,280
unite with all forces of justice,

43
00:03:15,599 --> 00:03:17,599
and completely dismantle the criminal syndicates

44
00:03:17,599 --> 00:03:19,560
that threaten our country and people.

45
00:03:33,560 --> 00:03:35,520
Recommending you to investigate this case in Country M

46
00:03:36,240 --> 00:03:37,199
was my decision.

47
00:03:40,800 --> 00:03:42,840
Back then, I couldn't bring my comrade back.

48
00:03:43,919 --> 00:03:46,439
This time, I hope you can bring his daughter

49
00:03:46,800 --> 00:03:48,000
back safely.

50
00:03:51,759 --> 00:03:52,319
Yes, sir.

51
00:04:55,360 --> 00:04:55,959
Not bad.

52
00:04:55,959 --> 00:04:57,000
That one's not bad either.

53
00:05:16,240 --> 00:05:18,040
When Mr. Ma approached me before,

54
00:05:18,600 --> 00:05:20,040
I did have some concerns.

55
00:05:20,360 --> 00:05:23,199
So I told him to meet Mr. Jiang first.

56
00:05:24,120 --> 00:05:25,879
Who knew that on your first shipment,

57
00:05:25,920 --> 00:05:26,879
not only did you botch it,

58
00:05:27,600 --> 00:05:29,120
you even alerted the police.

59
00:05:35,439 --> 00:05:37,519
It was my fault for mishandling it last time.

60
00:05:37,680 --> 00:05:39,120
I didn't expect the rented factory

61
00:05:39,240 --> 00:05:41,680
to be tied to Country M's stolen treasure.

62
00:05:42,160 --> 00:05:44,600
Now that Mr. Ma is finally out,

63
00:05:45,120 --> 00:05:45,800
even though the police

64
00:05:45,800 --> 00:05:47,399
are still following the stolen treasure

65
00:05:47,560 --> 00:05:48,360
leads to keep investigating,

66
00:05:49,319 --> 00:05:50,319
I believe

67
00:05:51,480 --> 00:05:52,639
our future operations

68
00:05:54,079 --> 00:05:55,560
won't be affected.

69
00:05:56,680 --> 00:05:58,040
How could they not be affected?

70
00:05:59,800 --> 00:06:01,560
Doesn't Xiao Zhuang have charges hanging over him too?

71
00:06:04,319 --> 00:06:06,120
Better safe than sorry.

72
00:06:06,360 --> 00:06:07,160
Over the years,

73
00:06:07,399 --> 00:06:10,040
I've put men in the government and police.

74
00:06:11,079 --> 00:06:12,079
As for your case,

75
00:06:12,240 --> 00:06:14,040
I'll find a way to have it buried.

76
00:06:14,279 --> 00:06:15,279
But remember this:

77
00:06:15,839 --> 00:06:17,920
do not provoke the police again,

78
00:06:18,120 --> 00:06:20,560
and above all, never cross The Four Great Families.

79
00:06:21,040 --> 00:06:22,199
Don't worry, sir.

80
00:06:22,680 --> 00:06:24,240
We've just arrived in Country M,

81
00:06:24,439 --> 00:06:25,399
as newcomers,

82
00:06:25,560 --> 00:06:28,000
we shouldn't cross paths with local gangs anyway.

83
00:06:29,079 --> 00:06:30,439
You're working for me now.

84
00:06:30,800 --> 00:06:33,680
The Four Great Families will find out.

85
00:06:34,120 --> 00:06:34,680
So,

86
00:06:35,199 --> 00:06:37,079
even if they pick a fight with you,

87
00:06:37,360 --> 00:06:39,040
you must hold back.

88
00:06:39,959 --> 00:06:43,120
With Mr. Theerade's power in Country M,

89
00:06:43,160 --> 00:06:46,680
are we really afraid of those four old geezers?

90
00:06:57,800 --> 00:06:59,160
It's not fear.

91
00:06:59,639 --> 00:07:00,759
It's respect.

92
00:07:01,759 --> 00:07:03,319
It's this respect

93
00:07:03,639 --> 00:07:04,839
that got me where I am today.

94
00:07:11,680 --> 00:07:12,560
So,

95
00:07:12,800 --> 00:07:15,079
how do you plan to expand the Greater China market?

96
00:07:16,839 --> 00:07:19,759
Previously, in Central and South China,

97
00:07:19,879 --> 00:07:21,240
as well as the Northeast,

98
00:07:21,480 --> 00:07:22,920
we brought in a lot of clients.

99
00:07:23,360 --> 00:07:24,399
However, right now,

100
00:07:24,519 --> 00:07:25,439
our business

101
00:07:25,759 --> 00:07:27,720
can only operate in South China

102
00:07:28,319 --> 00:07:30,759
because some transit stations ran into trouble.

103
00:07:31,240 --> 00:07:32,360
Don't worry, though.

104
00:07:32,399 --> 00:07:33,600
Give me three months,

105
00:07:33,839 --> 00:07:36,040
and I'll definitely get these transit stations

106
00:07:36,240 --> 00:07:37,920
running smoothly again.

107
00:07:38,319 --> 00:07:40,160
No, no, no.

108
00:07:41,639 --> 00:07:43,319
I don't have three months to wait for you.

109
00:07:46,120 --> 00:07:48,199
Sir, what Brother Ma means is,

110
00:07:48,199 --> 00:07:50,240
three months is just a conservative estimate.

111
00:07:50,720 --> 00:07:53,160
With Brother Ma's connections in China,

112
00:07:53,319 --> 00:07:54,759
bringing in major clients

113
00:07:55,040 --> 00:07:56,040
won't be a problem at all.

114
00:07:56,040 --> 00:07:56,879
It's very simple.

115
00:07:57,680 --> 00:07:59,319
I also have some potential clients lined up.

116
00:07:59,759 --> 00:08:01,319
If you trust us, sir,

117
00:08:01,839 --> 00:08:03,879
we'll break into the market as soon as possible.

118
00:08:04,800 --> 00:08:07,519
In a few days, Xiao Zhuang and I will head to Jiangyang.

119
00:08:07,759 --> 00:08:08,279
Mr. Theerade,

120
00:08:08,319 --> 00:08:10,120
you don't have to worry about the shipments.

121
00:08:12,560 --> 00:08:14,319
Prepare some samples for Mr. Ma.

122
00:08:15,759 --> 00:08:18,120
The drug market is a seller's market.

123
00:08:19,120 --> 00:08:20,360
We never lack buyers.

124
00:08:21,399 --> 00:08:23,160
But what about customs?

125
00:08:24,120 --> 00:08:25,079
How do we solve that?

126
00:08:26,519 --> 00:08:27,000
Sir,

127
00:08:27,319 --> 00:08:29,480
Xiao Zhuang has connections in mainland China too.

128
00:08:29,639 --> 00:08:31,480
I'll take care of customs clearance.

129
00:08:32,240 --> 00:08:33,120
Though...

130
00:08:33,600 --> 00:08:34,879
Money is not an issue.

131
00:08:35,039 --> 00:08:36,639
Discuss it with Mr. Jiang.

132
00:08:37,240 --> 00:08:40,879
Securing the Greater China market is what matters most.

133
00:08:40,879 --> 00:08:42,159
Rest assured, Mr. Theerade.

134
00:08:42,320 --> 00:08:43,639
Since you put it that way,

135
00:08:43,919 --> 00:08:45,960
I'll definitely do everything I can.

136
00:08:46,559 --> 00:08:47,159
Good.

137
00:08:47,720 --> 00:08:48,559
Then it's settled.

138
00:08:49,960 --> 00:08:52,559
Sir, I'll go get the goods ready.

139
00:08:52,720 --> 00:08:53,159
Okay.

140
00:08:56,679 --> 00:08:57,639
Mr. Theerade,

141
00:08:57,799 --> 00:08:58,840
the elders of The Four Great Families

142
00:08:58,879 --> 00:09:00,279
heard your hotel is opening today

143
00:09:00,360 --> 00:09:01,320
and sent over gifts.

144
00:09:01,320 --> 00:09:03,039
They're asking you to come greet them.

145
00:09:08,960 --> 00:09:10,799
Alright, let's go.

146
00:09:12,919 --> 00:09:13,480
This way.

147
00:09:24,080 --> 00:09:25,519
Congratulations.

148
00:09:25,519 --> 00:09:26,200
Welcome.

149
00:09:27,159 --> 00:09:27,720
Please.

150
00:09:46,039 --> 00:09:47,240
Theerade wants us

151
00:09:47,240 --> 00:09:48,879
to deliver on such short notice.

152
00:09:50,039 --> 00:09:50,559
Old Ma,

153
00:09:51,200 --> 00:09:53,799
could there be any issues on your end?

154
00:09:59,600 --> 00:10:01,360
Since Mr. Theerade put it that way,

155
00:10:01,840 --> 00:10:03,159
let's just get the job done right.

156
00:10:03,559 --> 00:10:04,679
Besides, I think

157
00:10:05,000 --> 00:10:06,480
Mr. Theerade has a point.

158
00:10:06,840 --> 00:10:08,240
As long as our stuff is good enough,

159
00:10:09,039 --> 00:10:10,360
we won't have trouble finding buyers.

160
00:10:12,200 --> 00:10:14,720
There shouldn't be any problem with buyers.

161
00:10:15,120 --> 00:10:16,720
You don't need to worry about that.

162
00:10:18,000 --> 00:10:20,919
In a few days, Xiao Zhuang will return to Jiangyang with me.

163
00:10:25,720 --> 00:10:26,399
Old Qin.

164
00:10:27,519 --> 00:10:30,480
There's a favor I need to ask of you.

165
00:10:31,120 --> 00:10:33,240
Old Ma, we're brothers.

166
00:10:33,480 --> 00:10:35,000
We're in the same boat now.

167
00:10:35,200 --> 00:10:36,279
Why be so polite?

168
00:10:36,399 --> 00:10:37,440
Just speak your mind.

169
00:10:38,440 --> 00:10:39,840
After I went to prison,

170
00:10:40,679 --> 00:10:42,399
I lost touch with a brother of mine

171
00:10:42,399 --> 00:10:43,639
named Li Qiang.

172
00:10:45,080 --> 00:10:46,200
But I believe

173
00:10:46,320 --> 00:10:47,639
as long as he's still alive,

174
00:10:48,080 --> 00:10:50,200
he'll definitely come back here to find me.

175
00:10:51,000 --> 00:10:52,120
If I'm not around,

176
00:10:53,000 --> 00:10:54,080
I'll leave him in your hands.

177
00:11:00,039 --> 00:11:00,799
Don't worry.

178
00:11:01,039 --> 00:11:03,440
I'll definitely take care of it for you.

179
00:11:13,399 --> 00:11:14,879
I'll remember you.

180
00:11:15,679 --> 00:11:16,480
Thank you.

181
00:11:17,559 --> 00:11:19,120
Though I'll forget you very soon.

182
00:11:20,000 --> 00:11:20,559
Take him away.

183
00:11:35,720 --> 00:11:37,320
The elders are tied up with business today,

184
00:11:37,360 --> 00:11:40,039
so they couldn't congratulate Mr. Theerade

185
00:11:40,039 --> 00:11:41,320
in person. Please excuse their absence.

186
00:11:43,639 --> 00:11:46,960
Please tell the elders when you return

187
00:11:47,279 --> 00:11:50,200
that Theerade is deeply touched by their kind thoughts.

188
00:11:51,399 --> 00:11:54,399
Mr. Theerade's theme park just opened,

189
00:11:54,399 --> 00:11:56,840
and now a new hotel has already been built.

190
00:11:57,480 --> 00:11:59,559
Your business is truly flourishing.

191
00:11:59,919 --> 00:12:01,159
However, this hotel, Mr. Theerade,

192
00:12:01,159 --> 00:12:03,039
seems to have crossed the line.

193
00:12:03,480 --> 00:12:06,759
The elders would like to hear your explanation.

194
00:12:09,159 --> 00:12:10,879
Before our hotel was built,

195
00:12:11,039 --> 00:12:14,279
we notified The Four Great Families.

196
00:12:14,840 --> 00:12:17,879
Today is Mr. Theerade's hotel opening.

197
00:12:18,000 --> 00:12:19,720
Are you looking for trouble?

198
00:12:28,840 --> 00:12:30,879
We're only here to deliver the elders' message.

199
00:12:31,120 --> 00:12:32,080
Mr. Theerade,

200
00:12:32,080 --> 00:12:33,919
if you have any issue with the elders,

201
00:12:34,200 --> 00:12:36,480
you can tell them in person.

202
00:12:36,799 --> 00:12:38,320
It seems Mr. Theerade

203
00:12:38,320 --> 00:12:40,279
doesn't wish to address this for now.

204
00:12:40,919 --> 00:12:43,120
Regardless, our message has been delivered.

205
00:12:43,120 --> 00:12:44,399
Farewell.

206
00:12:44,799 --> 00:12:45,759
How dare you!

207
00:12:46,320 --> 00:12:47,480
Is Mr. Theerade's place

208
00:12:47,639 --> 00:12:49,519
a place to come and go as you please?

209
00:12:51,840 --> 00:12:52,919
Mr. Theerade,

210
00:12:53,240 --> 00:12:55,320
are you defying The Four Great Families?

211
00:12:58,120 --> 00:12:59,039
Relax.

212
00:13:08,759 --> 00:13:10,159
Haven't I told you before?

213
00:13:10,240 --> 00:13:11,519
Toward The Four Great Families,

214
00:13:12,080 --> 00:13:13,200
you must not be so disrespectful.

215
00:13:24,639 --> 00:13:26,559
My men were out of line.

216
00:13:26,600 --> 00:13:28,159
Please don't take offense.

217
00:13:28,559 --> 00:13:31,440
Since the elders sent you with a message,

218
00:13:31,639 --> 00:13:34,080
I can't let you leave empty-handed.

219
00:13:47,960 --> 00:13:49,480
Here are four documents.

220
00:13:50,240 --> 00:13:55,320
They're shares for my New Tailai Hotel.

221
00:13:56,120 --> 00:13:59,519
Annually, each of The Four Great Families

222
00:13:59,519 --> 00:14:00,720
can receive from my hotel

223
00:14:00,720 --> 00:14:03,080
a ten percent share of the profits.

224
00:14:05,919 --> 00:14:09,320
In fact, the Elders don't need to tell me what to do.

225
00:14:09,799 --> 00:14:10,799
I already know what needs to be done.

226
00:14:11,720 --> 00:14:15,679
You won't need to draw knives or guns here from now on.

227
00:14:23,000 --> 00:14:25,399
I hope Mr. Theerade won't take offense.

228
00:14:25,519 --> 00:14:26,559
I won't see you out, then.

229
00:14:53,840 --> 00:14:54,639
Have you really decided

230
00:14:54,840 --> 00:14:55,919
to go to Jiangyang with Ma Jingrong?

231
00:14:56,519 --> 00:14:57,000
Yeah.

232
00:14:57,720 --> 00:14:59,159
If I don't handle things properly for Theerade,

233
00:14:59,279 --> 00:15:00,919
why would he trust me, right?

234
00:15:02,240 --> 00:15:02,879
No way.

235
00:15:03,320 --> 00:15:04,600
I think it's too dangerous for the two of you.

236
00:15:05,159 --> 00:15:06,080
Let me come with you.

237
00:15:06,320 --> 00:15:07,639
You know it's dangerous, yet you still want to tag along?

238
00:15:08,000 --> 00:15:09,200
Just stay right here

239
00:15:09,480 --> 00:15:10,519
and stop messing things up.

240
00:15:11,120 --> 00:15:12,240
Messing things up?

241
00:15:12,799 --> 00:15:13,639
If it weren't for me,

242
00:15:20,720 --> 00:15:21,200
if it weren't for me

243
00:15:21,200 --> 00:15:22,879
pulling you out of prison back then,

244
00:15:23,039 --> 00:15:24,600
you'd probably be dead in there by now.

245
00:15:26,080 --> 00:15:27,320
I'm just going there to talk business.

246
00:15:27,320 --> 00:15:28,440
What would you even do there?

247
00:15:28,759 --> 00:15:30,480
Having you around will only get in the way.

248
00:15:31,039 --> 00:15:32,200
All right, it's settled.

249
00:15:32,240 --> 00:15:32,960
Drop it.

250
00:15:33,559 --> 00:15:34,080
Can you please

251
00:15:34,080 --> 00:15:35,399
drop your macho attitude?

252
00:15:35,480 --> 00:15:36,320
I'm just worried about you,

253
00:15:36,399 --> 00:15:37,240
which is why I want to go with you.

254
00:15:37,279 --> 00:15:38,759
Why do you never understand?

255
00:15:38,759 --> 00:15:39,159
Wait,

256
00:15:44,600 --> 00:15:45,759
are you mad already?

257
00:16:19,559 --> 00:16:20,399
Don't be mad.

258
00:16:28,320 --> 00:16:29,320
Were you serious just now?

259
00:16:29,399 --> 00:16:30,600
You aren't actually mad, are you?

260
00:16:31,879 --> 00:16:32,759
Are you really mad?

261
00:16:37,320 --> 00:16:38,480
Life is a play,

262
00:16:38,759 --> 00:16:39,720
it's all about acting.

263
00:16:43,279 --> 00:16:44,399
Where to, you two?

264
00:16:45,360 --> 00:16:46,000
Hold on.

265
00:16:46,320 --> 00:16:47,320
Are you getting into character too?

266
00:16:47,360 --> 00:16:48,200
Just drive.

267
00:16:51,240 --> 00:16:52,960
Any news from Jiang Liye?

268
00:16:54,600 --> 00:16:56,519
He's indeed very cautious.

269
00:16:56,679 --> 00:16:57,879
Lately, wherever I go,

270
00:16:58,080 --> 00:16:59,080
he has someone tailing me.

271
00:17:01,480 --> 00:17:02,879
He doesn't completely trust me yet.

272
00:17:03,080 --> 00:17:04,960
We must be extra careful when we contact each other.

273
00:17:06,359 --> 00:17:08,119
I found that Jiang Liye has already sent men

274
00:17:08,160 --> 00:17:09,920
to tail Ma Jingrong and Li Siqi.

275
00:17:10,680 --> 00:17:13,119
I don't think he suspects the two of you yet.

276
00:17:14,279 --> 00:17:15,480
Still, from now on,

277
00:17:15,880 --> 00:17:16,880
we need to be even more cautious.

278
00:17:18,079 --> 00:17:18,720
Understood.

279
00:17:21,599 --> 00:17:23,119
What we're dealing with now

280
00:17:23,839 --> 00:17:25,880
are the kingpins of Country M's drug ring.

281
00:17:29,599 --> 00:17:31,319
The ones Theerade fears the most right now

282
00:17:31,319 --> 00:17:33,119
are The Four Great Families and Piyazi.

283
00:17:33,720 --> 00:17:34,480
If we can exploit

284
00:17:34,480 --> 00:17:35,680
the conflicts between them,

285
00:17:36,160 --> 00:17:37,519
could we take them all down at once?

286
00:17:39,480 --> 00:17:40,559
You're right.

287
00:17:41,000 --> 00:17:42,759
We can use their internal conflicts

288
00:17:43,160 --> 00:17:44,160
to wipe them all out together.

289
00:17:44,279 --> 00:17:45,279
But I've noticed

290
00:17:45,480 --> 00:17:47,160
Theerade got into the drug trade

291
00:17:47,400 --> 00:17:48,440
because one day he wants

292
00:17:48,640 --> 00:17:50,440
to rival The Four Great Families.

293
00:17:51,640 --> 00:17:52,680
In any case,

294
00:17:52,880 --> 00:17:53,799
our current objective

295
00:17:53,839 --> 00:17:55,640
is to keep a close eye on Theerade and Piyazi.

296
00:17:56,279 --> 00:17:58,160
Theerade wants to enter Southeast Asia,

297
00:17:58,279 --> 00:18:00,319
likely to expand his power quickly.

298
00:18:01,359 --> 00:18:01,839
That's right.

299
00:18:02,559 --> 00:18:03,319
Don't worry.

300
00:18:03,839 --> 00:18:04,839
I will personally coordinate

301
00:18:04,880 --> 00:18:06,720
the communication between Jiangyang and Nanhai police.

302
00:18:07,440 --> 00:18:08,000
All right.

303
00:18:15,559 --> 00:18:16,599
Any word on Li Qiang?

304
00:18:17,039 --> 00:18:18,160
We received a tip

305
00:18:18,440 --> 00:18:19,839
that people were smuggled into Country M.

306
00:18:20,319 --> 00:18:22,000
Two of them have descriptions

307
00:18:22,000 --> 00:18:23,640
very close to Li Qiang and Tian Xin.

308
00:18:24,359 --> 00:18:25,319
Rest assured, though.

309
00:18:25,519 --> 00:18:27,559
I've already planted someone near Qin Mu.

310
00:18:28,680 --> 00:18:30,119
Once there's news of Li Qiang,

311
00:18:30,200 --> 00:18:32,119
the Country M police will arrest him immediately.

312
00:19:31,599 --> 00:19:33,440
Attention on board!

313
00:19:34,079 --> 00:19:35,519
We are Country M police!

314
00:19:35,720 --> 00:19:39,039
We suspect you are illegal stowaways from China!

315
00:19:39,680 --> 00:19:41,519
Attention on board!

316
00:19:42,119 --> 00:19:43,559
We are Country M police!

317
00:19:44,319 --> 00:19:45,200
Can you swim?

318
00:19:48,200 --> 00:19:48,960
Hold on to me.

319
00:19:51,440 --> 00:19:52,440
Go! Over there!

320
00:20:32,440 --> 00:20:33,200
What's wrong?

321
00:20:34,559 --> 00:20:35,960
I really can't walk anymore.

322
00:20:39,279 --> 00:20:42,359
If you don't move, you won't survive.

323
00:20:46,240 --> 00:20:47,559
Then just let me die.

324
00:20:51,559 --> 00:20:53,319
I don't want to go with you anyway.

325
00:21:05,000 --> 00:21:06,640
I know it's all my fault,

326
00:21:07,759 --> 00:21:09,160
putting you through all this pain.

327
00:21:09,680 --> 00:21:10,519
Don't worry.

328
00:21:11,920 --> 00:21:13,480
I'll make it up to you.

329
00:21:16,759 --> 00:21:17,519
Make it up to me?

330
00:21:19,160 --> 00:21:20,160
How could you?

331
00:21:20,920 --> 00:21:22,480
Rather than be with you,

332
00:21:24,359 --> 00:21:26,079
I'd rather just die.

333
00:21:30,400 --> 00:21:32,000
You think being with him

334
00:21:32,559 --> 00:21:34,079
will keep you alive?

335
00:21:36,359 --> 00:21:37,240
Cut the crap!

336
00:21:38,599 --> 00:21:39,519
Get on your feet!

337
00:21:41,039 --> 00:21:42,079
Get up!

338
00:22:18,680 --> 00:22:19,279
Mr. Jiang.

339
00:22:19,319 --> 00:22:20,319
Is the shipment all ready?

340
00:22:20,480 --> 00:22:21,039
All set.

341
00:22:36,599 --> 00:22:38,920
These samples are our best stuff.

342
00:23:00,240 --> 00:23:01,759
Wishing you victory right from the start.

343
00:23:50,519 --> 00:23:52,000
After running around for so many days,

344
00:23:52,839 --> 00:23:54,480
a good piss washes all the worries away.

345
00:24:16,279 --> 00:24:16,920
Brother Four,

346
00:24:17,559 --> 00:24:18,880
when are we heading to Country M?

347
00:24:22,160 --> 00:24:24,039
Once we reach Boss Xiang,

348
00:24:24,119 --> 00:24:25,480
we'll know when we're going.

349
00:24:30,079 --> 00:24:31,880
These shoes are pretty comfortable.

350
00:24:35,680 --> 00:24:37,279
Major international brand, huh?

351
00:24:37,640 --> 00:24:38,559
They're knockoffs.

352
00:24:44,440 --> 00:24:46,000
I'll ask you one last time.

353
00:24:46,759 --> 00:24:48,079
Where did the stuff come from?

354
00:24:48,759 --> 00:24:51,400
If I talk, will I get two years knocked off?

355
00:24:52,079 --> 00:24:53,440
As long as you come clean,

356
00:24:53,680 --> 00:24:54,680
I won't pursue this.

357
00:24:55,400 --> 00:24:56,240
This stuff...

358
00:24:57,000 --> 00:24:59,599
Xiao Shen from Rolling Stone Nightclub sold it to me.

359
00:24:59,839 --> 00:25:00,759
Give me his full name.

360
00:25:01,400 --> 00:25:02,480
His name is Shen Qing.

361
00:25:02,519 --> 00:25:03,960
His boss is Yang Xing.

362
00:25:04,279 --> 00:25:06,279
I heard a lot of people have been buying from him lately.

363
00:25:06,680 --> 00:25:08,039
It's all Psychedelic Blues.

364
00:25:09,000 --> 00:25:12,079
Yang Xing from Rolling Stone Nightclub, right?

365
00:25:20,839 --> 00:25:21,599
Lao Si.

366
00:25:26,039 --> 00:25:26,920
Got it, Brother Nan.

367
00:25:27,079 --> 00:25:27,480
Understood.

368
00:25:28,079 --> 00:25:29,359
See you later, then.

369
00:25:32,079 --> 00:25:33,880
Are we going to see Brother Nan, Brother Four?

370
00:25:35,880 --> 00:25:36,440
Yeah.

371
00:25:37,359 --> 00:25:38,480
I set up a meeting with him.

372
00:25:38,519 --> 00:25:40,759
Ten tonight at Rolling Stone Nightclub.

373
00:26:02,400 --> 00:26:03,720
The target of tonight's arrest operation

374
00:26:03,759 --> 00:26:05,720
is Yang Xing, owner of Rolling Stone Club.

375
00:26:05,920 --> 00:26:07,160
According to our investigation,

376
00:26:07,359 --> 00:26:09,000
many drug dealers in Jiangyang

377
00:26:09,039 --> 00:26:10,759
bought their supply from Yang Xing,

378
00:26:10,799 --> 00:26:12,400
the new drug, Psychedelic Blues.

379
00:26:12,839 --> 00:26:14,079
We believe that capturing Yang Xing

380
00:26:14,200 --> 00:26:15,599
will lead us to Cheng Weimin's location.

381
00:26:16,359 --> 00:26:16,880
However,

382
00:26:17,759 --> 00:26:19,319
Piyazi is also looking for him.

383
00:26:19,599 --> 00:26:21,119
We must beat them to it.

384
00:26:23,559 --> 00:26:24,559
If we find Cheng Weimin,

385
00:26:24,920 --> 00:26:25,839
we'll have the chance

386
00:26:25,920 --> 00:26:28,039
to lure out the Poison Wolf, Xiang Nan.

387
00:26:29,599 --> 00:26:31,200
Tonight's operation will be split into two teams.

388
00:26:31,400 --> 00:26:32,079
I'll take a few officers

389
00:26:32,119 --> 00:26:33,599
to stake out inside Rolling Stone Nightclub.

390
00:26:33,799 --> 00:26:35,319
The rest will wait outside for my signal.

391
00:26:35,720 --> 00:26:36,720
According to our intelligence,

392
00:26:36,920 --> 00:26:38,359
Yang Xing will be dealing tonight.

393
00:26:39,119 --> 00:26:41,839
So we must catch him red-handed.

394
00:26:44,200 --> 00:26:44,759
Let's move out!

395
00:27:53,039 --> 00:27:53,559
Keep up.

396
00:27:59,359 --> 00:28:00,200
All units, be advised.

397
00:28:00,400 --> 00:28:01,759
The suspect has entered the nightclub.

398
00:28:01,839 --> 00:28:02,920
Stand by to make the arrest.

399
00:28:18,839 --> 00:28:19,400
Brother Four

400
00:28:37,519 --> 00:28:39,640
Why are there cops outside the nightclub?

401
00:28:39,960 --> 00:28:41,839
Are they here for Brother Nan?

402
00:28:46,759 --> 00:28:47,240
Brother Four.

403
00:28:48,200 --> 00:28:49,319
Don't tip them off yet.

404
00:28:49,720 --> 00:28:50,559
I'll go down and take a look.

405
00:28:51,799 --> 00:28:52,559
Be careful.

406
00:29:12,759 --> 00:29:14,319
They should be in the innermost private room.

407
00:29:14,359 --> 00:29:15,279
There are guards at the door.

408
00:29:17,240 --> 00:29:19,359
Move in as soon as the deal goes down.

409
00:29:19,440 --> 00:29:20,119
They won't get away.

410
00:29:20,440 --> 00:29:21,079
Got it.

411
00:29:25,319 --> 00:29:25,880
Wait.

412
00:29:32,720 --> 00:29:33,640
Municipal Police.

413
00:29:34,000 --> 00:29:35,000
Where's your boss?

414
00:29:35,079 --> 00:29:35,519
I don't know.

415
00:29:35,640 --> 00:29:36,599
I just work here.

416
00:29:36,640 --> 00:29:37,519
Our manager is over there.

417
00:29:42,400 --> 00:29:43,839
Where's your boss?

418
00:29:44,000 --> 00:29:44,960
The boss isn't here.

419
00:29:45,039 --> 00:29:46,200
You can talk to me.

420
00:29:47,559 --> 00:29:48,319
Talk to you?

421
00:29:48,960 --> 00:29:51,000
Think you can handle a matter of life and death?

422
00:29:51,440 --> 00:29:51,960
Move.

423
00:30:02,319 --> 00:30:03,119
Attention, all units.

424
00:30:03,720 --> 00:30:05,640
Suspect Xiang Nan has entered the nightclub.

425
00:30:06,079 --> 00:30:07,240
The club is too crowded.

426
00:30:07,680 --> 00:30:09,640
Xiang Nan and his men are likely armed.

427
00:30:09,799 --> 00:30:11,480
Making the arrest here is too risky,

428
00:30:11,680 --> 00:30:13,160
and civilians could get hurt.

429
00:30:13,400 --> 00:30:14,720
We're changing the plan.

430
00:30:14,960 --> 00:30:16,359
Once they leave the nightclub,

431
00:30:16,599 --> 00:30:17,519
move in for the arrest immediately.

432
00:31:14,480 --> 00:31:15,920
Xiang Nan told me and Four-Legged Snake

433
00:31:15,960 --> 00:31:17,240
to meet him at Rolling Stone Nightclub.

434
00:31:17,480 --> 00:31:18,400
But the Jiangyang police

435
00:31:18,440 --> 00:31:20,160
are already staking out the entrance.

436
00:31:20,319 --> 00:31:21,680
If they arrest Xiang Nan,

437
00:31:22,039 --> 00:31:23,599
Operation Thunderbolt must be aborted.

438
00:31:23,799 --> 00:31:24,799
We have a plan now

439
00:31:24,960 --> 00:31:26,319
that requires Jiangyang police's help,

440
00:31:26,480 --> 00:31:27,359
to let me approach Xiang Nan

441
00:31:27,400 --> 00:31:28,440
and win his trust.

442
00:31:28,559 --> 00:31:29,240
I'll contact them.

443
00:31:29,599 --> 00:31:30,559
Stay safe out there.

444
00:31:38,680 --> 00:31:40,160
Chief Zhou, this is Bai Hua.

445
00:31:46,880 --> 00:31:47,400
Understood.

446
00:31:51,319 --> 00:31:52,319
Don't worry, Chief Zhou.

447
00:31:52,880 --> 00:31:53,759
I'll handle the arrangements.

448
00:32:02,559 --> 00:32:03,440
All units, attention.

449
00:32:04,079 --> 00:32:05,359
Change of plans for the arrest operation.

450
00:32:10,759 --> 00:32:11,799
Five hundred grams each.

451
00:32:12,480 --> 00:32:13,960
The recipients and addresses

452
00:32:14,079 --> 00:32:15,599
have been sent to your phones.

453
00:32:16,599 --> 00:32:17,039
Remember,

454
00:32:19,039 --> 00:32:20,240
be extremely careful.

455
00:32:20,960 --> 00:32:22,400
If you spot anyone tailing you,

456
00:32:22,759 --> 00:32:23,720
call off the deal immediately.

457
00:32:24,119 --> 00:32:24,880
Don't worry, bro.

458
00:32:24,960 --> 00:32:26,319
The boys have never slipped up.

459
00:32:27,119 --> 00:32:28,000
Alright, then...

460
00:32:33,359 --> 00:32:33,920
What are you doing?

461
00:32:33,920 --> 00:32:34,920
They're cops!

462
00:32:35,119 --> 00:32:35,799
Back off!

463
00:32:36,000 --> 00:32:37,000
Don't move! Don't move!

464
00:32:37,039 --> 00:32:37,839
Step back!

465
00:32:39,720 --> 00:32:40,559
You're not cops.

466
00:32:41,400 --> 00:32:43,559
If I were a cop, you'd be lucky!

467
00:32:50,400 --> 00:32:51,200
Not bad.

468
00:32:52,559 --> 00:32:53,559
Top grade stuff.

469
00:32:57,599 --> 00:32:59,200
Do you know whose stash this is?

470
00:33:02,880 --> 00:33:03,400
Sit.

471
00:33:04,319 --> 00:33:04,960
Sit down and talk.

472
00:33:09,480 --> 00:33:10,880
This is my stash.

473
00:33:11,960 --> 00:33:13,519
How did it end up in your hands?

474
00:33:14,680 --> 00:33:15,599
I really don't know!

475
00:33:16,240 --> 00:33:16,960
I have no idea!

476
00:33:17,119 --> 00:33:18,599
I bought it from my supplier!

477
00:33:19,400 --> 00:33:20,960
Cheng Weimin, right?

478
00:33:26,480 --> 00:33:28,160
Cheng Weimin is my distributor.

479
00:33:28,160 --> 00:33:29,839
He ran off with my goods.

480
00:33:31,440 --> 00:33:33,200
Xiaotian, take all the stash.

481
00:33:33,319 --> 00:33:33,839
Got it.

482
00:33:36,039 --> 00:33:38,119
I know you got the stuff from Cheng Weimin.

483
00:33:38,319 --> 00:33:39,160
Where is he?

484
00:33:41,799 --> 00:33:42,720
Even if I wanted to tell you,

485
00:33:42,799 --> 00:33:44,160
I truly don't know where he is.

486
00:33:45,039 --> 00:33:45,839
I'm telling the truth!

487
00:33:45,920 --> 00:33:46,920
I really don't know!

488
00:33:57,799 --> 00:33:58,480
I really don't know.

489
00:33:59,279 --> 00:34:00,279
I honestly don't!

490
00:34:00,559 --> 00:34:01,880
He always contacts me first.

491
00:34:02,240 --> 00:34:03,240
I can't reach him at all.

492
00:34:04,200 --> 00:34:05,799
He changes his number all the time.

493
00:34:06,759 --> 00:34:09,000
If I can find you, I can find him.

494
00:34:11,920 --> 00:34:12,679
I'll talk.

495
00:34:12,800 --> 00:34:13,280
I'll talk!

496
00:34:13,760 --> 00:34:14,239
I'll talk!

497
00:34:27,559 --> 00:34:29,679
He owes me some money for the goods.

498
00:34:30,360 --> 00:34:30,840
When the time comes...

499
00:34:30,960 --> 00:34:32,639
He'll call me in a couple of days.

500
00:34:32,920 --> 00:34:33,159
When he does,

501
00:34:33,239 --> 00:34:34,760
I'll give you the exact time and place.

502
00:34:34,760 --> 00:34:35,360
Sound good, Boss?

503
00:34:36,119 --> 00:34:37,039
Too much trouble.

504
00:34:37,480 --> 00:34:39,320
Just come with me.

505
00:34:42,480 --> 00:34:43,039
Move.

506
00:34:43,360 --> 00:34:43,880
Move!

507
00:34:45,199 --> 00:34:45,679
Boss!

508
00:34:46,159 --> 00:34:46,639
Ah Qing!

509
00:35:02,440 --> 00:35:03,079
Hey, are you there?

510
00:35:03,199 --> 00:35:03,519
I'm here.

511
00:35:03,800 --> 00:35:04,280
Brother Nan.

512
00:35:04,519 --> 00:35:05,679
Keep quiet. Listen to me.

513
00:35:05,960 --> 00:35:08,239
There are cops all over the club entrance.

514
00:35:08,599 --> 00:35:10,559
Have A-Hao's group use the front door.

515
00:35:10,880 --> 00:35:12,480
Bring Yang Xing out through the back door.

516
00:35:12,880 --> 00:35:14,159
I'll meet you at the back door.

517
00:35:14,920 --> 00:35:15,760
Okay, got it.

518
00:35:25,199 --> 00:35:25,960
What's wrong, Brother Nan?

519
00:35:27,159 --> 00:35:27,840
Nothing.

520
00:35:28,480 --> 00:35:29,440
Wait for me downstairs.

521
00:35:30,280 --> 00:35:31,639
I'm taking him to grab something.

522
00:35:32,480 --> 00:35:33,400
Behave yourself.

523
00:35:33,679 --> 00:35:35,199
Boss, where are we going?

524
00:35:35,599 --> 00:35:36,880
Try to run, and I'll kill you.

525
00:35:44,840 --> 00:35:45,679
All units, be advised.

526
00:35:45,840 --> 00:35:46,760
They're coming out now.

527
00:35:46,960 --> 00:35:48,039
Get ready to move in for the arrest.

528
00:35:55,400 --> 00:35:55,840
Move in!

529
00:36:00,079 --> 00:36:00,360
Drop it!

530
00:36:00,360 --> 00:36:01,320
Don't move! Don't move!

531
00:36:02,159 --> 00:36:02,719
Don't move!

532
00:36:10,719 --> 00:36:11,960
Uncle Guang, the front is secured.

533
00:36:12,000 --> 00:36:12,679
How's the back?

534
00:36:12,920 --> 00:36:14,039
Poison Wolf hasn't shown up yet.

535
00:36:26,519 --> 00:36:27,880
Police! Come out and surrender!

536
00:36:34,239 --> 00:36:34,840
Get in the car!

537
00:37:03,559 --> 00:37:04,440
Suspect spotted at the back door.

538
00:37:04,760 --> 00:37:05,960
Suspect is driving toward Xiaguang Road.

539
00:37:06,119 --> 00:37:06,840
Requesting backup.

540
00:37:06,880 --> 00:37:07,440
Get in the car.

541
00:37:22,440 --> 00:37:23,039
What are you doing?

542
00:37:23,480 --> 00:37:24,039
Everyone, get out!

543
00:37:24,760 --> 00:37:25,679
The cops are right behind us!

544
00:37:25,800 --> 00:37:26,320
Are you crazy?

545
00:37:27,360 --> 00:37:28,679
The cops are locked onto us right now.

546
00:37:28,960 --> 00:37:30,000
We're actually safer on foot.

547
00:37:30,119 --> 00:37:31,000
Trust me.

548
00:37:32,840 --> 00:37:33,360
Move!

549
00:38:00,079 --> 00:38:00,559
Hurry, let's go!

550
00:38:08,400 --> 00:38:10,519
Police! Don't move!

551
00:38:11,679 --> 00:38:12,239
Don't move!

552
00:38:18,960 --> 00:38:19,360
Take them away!

553
00:38:19,719 --> 00:38:20,159
Move!

554
00:38:20,519 --> 00:38:21,199
Move, move, move!

555
00:38:21,320 --> 00:38:22,000
Keep moving! Hurry!

556
00:38:23,039 --> 00:38:23,519
Hurry!

557
00:38:37,840 --> 00:38:39,079
So you're Wei Kai.

558
00:38:42,360 --> 00:38:43,400
Former cop.

559
00:38:43,880 --> 00:38:44,840
Ex-special forces.

560
00:38:47,440 --> 00:38:49,000
You did right not killing him.

561
00:38:51,159 --> 00:38:52,280
Stick with me from now on.

562
00:38:52,480 --> 00:38:54,119
I take good care of my own men.

563
00:39:02,760 --> 00:39:04,800
If it weren't for you today,

564
00:39:04,840 --> 00:39:06,920
I wouldn't have lost so many men.

565
00:39:07,679 --> 00:39:08,920
I didn't want this either, Boss.

566
00:39:09,079 --> 00:39:11,320
You guys came looking for me.

567
00:39:11,320 --> 00:39:12,440
I wasn't looking for trouble.

568
00:39:13,119 --> 00:39:14,960
When will Cheng Weimin contact you?

569
00:39:16,000 --> 00:39:17,119
He said in a day or two.

570
00:39:17,400 --> 00:39:18,039
Exactly when?

571
00:39:18,159 --> 00:39:18,960
I honestly don't know.

572
00:39:20,199 --> 00:39:22,239
The cops are already onto you.

573
00:39:23,440 --> 00:39:25,679
With me, you can stay alive a bit longer.

574
00:39:31,199 --> 00:39:32,760
We were already exposed tonight.

575
00:39:33,320 --> 00:39:34,960
Maybe we should just run.

576
00:39:36,039 --> 00:39:36,840
Are you scared?

577
00:39:39,559 --> 00:39:41,679
Cheng Weimin broke the boss's rules.

578
00:39:42,079 --> 00:39:43,519
We can't just let him off the hook.

579
00:39:43,800 --> 00:39:45,000
Besides, he still has

580
00:39:45,039 --> 00:39:46,559
a lot of our client files.

581
00:39:48,559 --> 00:39:49,920
What do we do next then?

582
00:39:52,239 --> 00:39:54,920
First, use this kid to find Cheng Weimin.

583
00:39:59,719 --> 00:40:01,239
Then we head back to Country M.

584
00:40:06,239 --> 00:40:07,559
How does Cheng Weimin contact you?

585
00:40:08,760 --> 00:40:09,559
He calls me.

586
00:40:09,679 --> 00:40:10,440
Where's the phone?

587
00:40:12,199 --> 00:40:13,320
In my pants pocket.

588
00:40:24,079 --> 00:40:24,800
His cover's blown.

589
00:40:31,679 --> 00:40:32,440
Starting now,

590
00:40:32,679 --> 00:40:34,599
turn this phone on only once an hour,

591
00:40:34,599 --> 00:40:35,960
and for no more than a minute at a time.

592
00:40:36,039 --> 00:40:37,679
If someone calls and can't reach him,

593
00:40:37,880 --> 00:40:39,039
they'll probably send a text.

594
00:40:40,639 --> 00:40:42,000
It's fine. It doesn't matter if it's off.

595
00:40:42,480 --> 00:40:44,519
It shows missed calls once turned on.

596
00:40:55,360 --> 00:40:57,519
Once you go ashore, go straight to Uncle Gen.

597
00:40:57,719 --> 00:40:59,000
He'll arrange everything for you.

598
00:40:59,280 --> 00:41:01,599
You'll take a bus disguised as tourists

599
00:41:01,880 --> 00:41:03,679
and head to Jiangyang.

600
00:41:05,119 --> 00:41:06,320
While I'm away,

601
00:41:07,159 --> 00:41:08,400
take good care of Siqi for me.

602
00:41:10,599 --> 00:41:11,760
Don't worry, Old Ma.

603
00:41:13,159 --> 00:41:14,840
Boss Ma, Zhuang,

604
00:41:15,320 --> 00:41:17,719
take care on the road.

605
00:41:18,559 --> 00:41:19,159
Thanks.

606
00:41:20,639 --> 00:41:22,679
Didn't you say you wanted to visit mainland China?

607
00:41:23,000 --> 00:41:23,880
Come on, let's go together!

608
00:41:25,119 --> 00:41:26,679
Me? Forget it.

609
00:41:26,840 --> 00:41:27,960
As someone from Country M,

610
00:41:28,079 --> 00:41:30,519
I'd draw too much attention there.

611
00:41:30,800 --> 00:41:31,480
Come on!

612
00:41:31,840 --> 00:41:33,679
It's just business. What are you afraid of?

613
00:41:34,119 --> 00:41:35,000
If you're scared,

614
00:41:35,159 --> 00:41:36,039
you shouldn't be in this game.

615
00:41:37,000 --> 00:41:38,320
Me, scared?

616
00:41:40,400 --> 00:41:41,199
I'm just afraid...

617
00:41:41,480 --> 00:41:42,840
will you and Boss Ma

618
00:41:42,960 --> 00:41:45,199
even make it out of that hellhole alive?

619
00:41:45,880 --> 00:41:47,000
Right, Boss Ma?

620
00:42:11,360 --> 00:42:12,079
I've made up my mind.

621
00:42:12,440 --> 00:42:13,599
I'm going with you.

622
00:42:16,280 --> 00:42:17,039
We're going on business.

623
00:42:17,119 --> 00:42:18,039
Why do you want to tag along?

624
00:42:19,159 --> 00:42:20,320
I don't want to be left alone anymore,

625
00:42:20,320 --> 00:42:22,079
waiting anxiously for news from you.

626
00:42:23,400 --> 00:42:25,760
If you're going, I'm coming with you.

627
00:42:26,840 --> 00:42:28,480
Please don't leave me behind again.

628
00:42:29,480 --> 00:42:30,639
We're doing business.

629
00:42:30,800 --> 00:42:31,760
Having you around

630
00:42:33,719 --> 00:42:34,400
is trouble.

631
00:42:35,280 --> 00:42:36,280
Leaving me behind alone...

632
00:42:36,320 --> 00:42:37,400
isn't that trouble too?

633
00:42:38,159 --> 00:42:39,920
Do you trust that guy Jiang that much?

634
00:42:42,480 --> 00:42:43,199
What are you talking about?

635
00:42:44,000 --> 00:42:45,800
When Xiaobai came to ask me to save you,

636
00:42:46,280 --> 00:42:47,679
Mr. Jiang tested her.

637
00:42:51,400 --> 00:42:52,280
Did he give you a hard time?

638
00:42:54,800 --> 00:42:56,440
Mr. Jiang didn't trust her at the time,

639
00:42:56,599 --> 00:42:57,239
so...

640
00:42:58,679 --> 00:43:00,000
Under those circumstances,

641
00:43:00,760 --> 00:43:02,960
it's truly hard for anyone to accept.

642
00:43:05,360 --> 00:43:06,320
Jiang Liye is a man

643
00:43:06,440 --> 00:43:07,880
who has always been cautious.

644
00:43:08,159 --> 00:43:10,440
He didn't know Miss Ge at first,

645
00:43:10,480 --> 00:43:13,199
so crossing the line a bit was inevitable.

646
00:43:14,440 --> 00:43:15,000
Besides,

647
00:43:15,079 --> 00:43:16,960
now that Miss Ge insists on going with you,

648
00:43:16,960 --> 00:43:18,679
I actually think it's a good thing.

649
00:43:18,679 --> 00:43:20,320
Having a woman by your side

650
00:43:20,639 --> 00:43:22,000
can always serve as good cover.

651
00:43:28,519 --> 00:43:29,079
All right.

652
00:43:34,199 --> 00:43:35,480
Okay, it's getting late.

653
00:43:36,760 --> 00:43:37,840
You should head out early.

654
00:43:42,239 --> 00:43:42,840
Let's go, Xiao Zhuang.

655
00:43:42,920 --> 00:43:43,599
Right behind you, Boss.

656
00:44:17,840 --> 00:44:18,559
Mr. Mai,

657
00:44:19,760 --> 00:44:22,519
is there any news on Li Qiang?

658
00:44:24,280 --> 00:44:25,239
Not yet.

659
00:44:26,360 --> 00:44:27,800
I heard from Chief Zhou

660
00:44:28,119 --> 00:44:29,119
that this time, Li Qiang

661
00:44:29,159 --> 00:44:30,599
crossed the border with a hostage.

662
00:44:30,800 --> 00:44:31,719
I'm puzzled.

663
00:44:32,280 --> 00:44:33,679
Why would he do that?

664
00:44:40,920 --> 00:44:41,599
Revenge.
